Parameters to complete:

- Solubility (mg/mL) as a function of pH.
- Effective intestinal permeability (cm/s).
- Fraction absorbed (Fa).
- First-pass extraction fraction.
- Volume of distribution (L/kg or L).
- Total systemic clearance (L/h or L/h/kg).
- Split of renal vs. non-renal clearance.
- Terminal half-life in your population of interest.
- Any specific enzyme kinetic parameters you plan to represent mechanistically.

